This directory is intentionally empty.

Vercel's "Other" framework preset requires a static output directory named
`public` after the build completes, and fails the deployment without one:

  Error: No Output Directory named "public" found after the Build completed.

apps/server has no static output — it is a single serverless function at
api/index.ts, and its `build` script is `tsc --noEmit`, which emits nothing.
This empty directory satisfies the check.

Nothing is ever served from here. vercel.json rewrites every path to
/api/index, so no static file in this directory is reachable even if one were
added. Do not put anything in it.
